h-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10CumulativeLevelSuccessor}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10CumulativeLevelSuccessor}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}cumulative\\text{-}level\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSet10CumulativeLevelSuccessor}_S(\\vec V,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec V,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec V),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec V))\\land\\{\\alpha,\\alpha+1\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec V)\\land\\vec V(\\alpha+1)=\\mathcal P(\\vec V(\\alpha))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}cumulative\\text{-}level\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSet10CumulativeLevelSuccessor}_S(\\vec V,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec V,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec V),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec V))\\land\\{\\alpha,\\alpha+1\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec V)\\land\\vec V(\\alpha+1)=\\mathcal P(\\vec V(\\alpha))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The hierarchy parameter is used as a function, and both stages appearing in the successor equation are required to lie in its domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batc